#. macro: <if $gn4>her<else>him</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "quest/004/SubSea114_00411:TEXT_SUBSEA114_00411_MIMIDOA_000_20:1"
msgid "Eh? Where'd ye crawl in from? I don't recall sendin' for no 'nitiates. Eh? <string $gs1>? I once knew a <if $gn4>lass<else>lad</if> named <split \" \" 1><string $gs1></split> back when I served on the <i>Cloud Dancer</i>. <if $gn4>She was a buxom young lass with eyes as big an' round as ogre pumpkins<else>He was a strappin' young lad with teeth as white as a princess's paps</if>. Ye ain't <if $gn4>her<else>him</if>, though. Nose ain't quite right... And who are ye, again? Ah, got somethin' to tell me, has ye?"
msgstr ""

#. ja: カワイコちゃんに、背負ってもらってな！<br>いや、むしろ腕に抱かれるほうが……。
#. de: Eine nette Freundin, die sich um ihn kümmert ... das ist, was ihm fehlt. So einsam, wie er da oben ist.
#. fr: Hmm... Si je demande à une jolie fille de me porter sur son dos, ou encore mieux, dans ses bras, ça me rendra assurément le trajet plus facile... et agréable<nbsp>! Hé hé hé...
#. speaker: MIMIDOA
msgctxt "quest/004/SubSea114_00411:TEXT_SUBSEA114_00411_MIMIDOA_000_21:1"
msgid "Rostnzeh? What's that mumblin' milksop whinin' about this time? No, let me guess─that he's lonely? Bah! Put a pair of warm women in his arms and 'nother on his lap, and he'll be right as rain!"
msgstr ""

#. ja: むむ、ワシがカワイコちゃんにくっつきたくて、<br>アヤツをダシに使ってるわけじゃないぞい？<br>すべては、さびしがり屋のロストンゼッヘのためじゃ！
#. de: Harharhar! Wenn wir zehn Jahr jünger wär'n, würden wir nachts durch die Schenken ziehen, aber die Zeiten sind vorbei. Aber vielleicht schmeißen wir mal eine Party auf dem Leuchtturm. Das wär doch was!
#. fr: Ah<nbsp>! Qu'est-ce qu'il ne faut pas faire pour remonter le moral d'un vieil ami, franchement<nbsp>!?
#. speaker: MIMIDOA
msgctxt "quest/004/SubSea114_00411:TEXT_SUBSEA114_00411_MIMIDOA_000_22:1"
msgid "'Tis what I do to help me forget that what ails me...not that ol' Mimidoa needs much help with forgettin', mind ye. Might be that I'll send him up a few saucy strumpets this comin' eve!"
msgstr ""
